# The J1939 manufacturer table is built from the SAE Digital Annex or from the
# public ISO 11783 registry. Neither is ours to redistribute, so the file that
# holds it stays on the machine that built it.
#
# Note what is NOT ignored: data/j1939-names-functions.csv. That one is derived
# from AgIsoStack++ under the MIT licence and does ship - see its header.
data/j1939-names.csv
**/data/j1939-names.csv
